{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:893b042befa59a0503a55e1e7aae931cdd3907ee8d2c5d99de015cda7f62f156",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_b:2_4_017_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff5db3ff9b97e8d6590bc7f61b01750eb5f4c71040992ebbbb0508d79f8688b6",
      "text": "下雨真愉快喵～，就算每天都在下，听起来也每天\n都是不一样的声音喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_b:2_4_017_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b7e22970dfc673d4a8afd6fb45109e72a087b84fb615dac73c4c0c66e7206ed",
      "text": "落语里也有很多种描写雨声的表现喵。\n能够让人体会到日语之美喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_b:2_4_017_02_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aeee2ad1f0c06631f0c946a56f95fd5e9ac98967bdca9f8336f096367e3589d",
      "text": "在●●●●プロデューサー君听来，昨天的雨声是\n怎样的声音喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_b:2_4_017_02_09_b:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43ad0fcaa1c3adf327cd1b2401582313af7b7ab0a47d25be77cc23374cfe374e",
      "text": "淅淅沥沥",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_b:2_4_017_02_09_b:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb13d7181a74b13f5e65ab3683aa01f1ac21aa2ad8e71539928cc669d1f2c4ed",
      "text": "哗啦哗啦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_b:2_4_017_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c0951e12777474a83a7c5cb943591caaa880342d49561bfbe0c285e8eb4dff8",
      "text": "喵喵！？这比吾辈听到的声音要\n安静得多喵！在吾辈耳朵里可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_b:2_4_017_02_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71eefd2f3c50994cd317dcd6b2ee210664ef5eec51788d95e14ce1b18ad2d1c2",
      "text": "滋啦～……哗啦哗啦哗啦……唰啦～……\n噼啪！轰隆隆隆！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_b:2_4_017_02_09_b:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a8ce0d7d4f789ebc40463f7a65f90ef4b0cb121b581c6b433b74bfa4f5b69a5",
      "text": "打雷了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_b:2_4_017_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8de8bc9fc7f93310a70bd0ba4c39534e7fcf26c89eab4a917d1093062455671",
      "text": "哎呀失礼了，一边回忆一边觉得好玩，不知不觉\n模拟起来就太起劲了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_b:2_4_017_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7950addc58c785d576e26bf716e5869beaf135f718b5d6efe76e9973339090d",
      "text": "话虽如此，这也是雨天能听到的声音之一\n喵～。真的会有各种各样的声音喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_b:2_4_017_02_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcfb82a82238abcda83a9c047e9a0fa68ef58d7a7c0d64d27ca87db8046f26ef",
      "text": "要是又听到了新的声音，制作人君也要\n听吾辈说说喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
